Subject: [PATCH] Keep the browser from calling Google in the background

---
 services/network/url_loader_factory.cc | 81 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 81 insertions(+)

diff --git a/services/network/url_loader_factory.cc b/services/network/url_loader_factory.cc
index 541b9e627d41503f8b17984e15a7e6359d0df1ea..87ee3effca24ec06a6be79f53ed994ca268c6a4c 100644
--- a/services/network/url_loader_factory.cc
